###
# Stage G - Step 3: Reviews Testing
# Tests the POST /motards/{userId}/reviews endpoint
# Current date: Nov 13, 2025 (future tour: Nov 25, past tour: Sept 15)
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5256/api
@organizerId = 998d74ae-4e06-4933-88e1-78d4cc7c7be8
@participant1Id = participant1
@participant2Id = participant2

###
# Setup: Login as participant1 (alice@example.com / Test123!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "participant1",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "pass"
}

###
# 1. Get the future tour (Nov 25) to create new booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/tours

### from bookings get past tourid and use it to get detail of the tour
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/tours/08de22ba-5ec7-4245-82b9-bb8d05993d0f
###
# 2. Create a new booking on future tour (for testing "tour not started yet" error)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tourId": "08de22ba-5ebb-4451-837a-e5daca1bc210",
  "tourMotardId": "08de22ba-5ec0-479c-8161-0da0d711864a",
  "emergencyContact": "+33 6 11 22 33 44"
}

###
@createFutureBooking = {{createBooking.response.body.bookingId}}

###
# 2b. Logout participant1, login as motard1 to approve
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "motard1",
  "email": "charlie@example.com",
  "password": "pass"
}

###
# 2c. Approve the booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{createFutureBooking}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

###
# 2d. Logout organizer, login back as participant1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "participant1",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "pass"
}

###
# 2e. Pay for the booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/pay/{{createFutureBooking}}
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#   "bookingId": "{{createFutureBooking}}",
#   "paymentMethod": "CreditCard"
# }

###
# 3. ❌ Try to review BEFORE tour date - should fail (400)
# Now the booking is Paid, but tour hasn't happened yet (Nov 25 > Nov 13)
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/cf8152ba-b995-4c0e-afe3-60512d7f4e66/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "{{createFutureBooking}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Trying to review before tour happens"
}

###
# 4. ✅ Create review on PAST tour (Sept 15) - should succeed
# Past tour booking1 is participant1 → organizer (paid, completed)
# Booking IDs are dynamic, so we need to get them first
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings

###
# @name getPastBooking
# Find the paid booking for past tour (you'll need to copy bookingId from response)

###
# 5. ✅ Submit valid review with comment (use actual bookingId from GET /bookings)
# @name createReview
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de22ba-5ec8-40c1-82c0-39ea79af0cc1",
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Great experience! Very professional and safe riding."
}

###
# 6. ❌ Try to review same booking again - should fail (400 duplicate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de22ba-5ec8-40c1-82c0-39ea79af0cc1",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Another review"
}

###
# 7. ❌ Invalid rating (0) - should fail (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de22ba-5ec8-40c1-82c0-39ea79af0cc1",
  "rating": 0,
  "comment": "Invalid rating test"
}

###
# 8. ❌ Invalid rating (6) - should fail (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de22ba-5ec8-40c1-82c0-39ea79af0cc1",
  "rating": 6,
  "comment": "Invalid rating test"
}

###
# 9. ✅ Review without comment (optional comment) - should succeed
# Need another past booking - participant2 has one on same past tour
# Logout and login as participant2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "participant2",
  "password": "pass"
}

###
# 10. Get participant2's bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings

###
# 11. ✅ Review without comment (use participant2's past booking ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de22ba-5ecd-4831-8785-258b8d13e00a",
  "rating": 3
}

###
# 12. ❌ Try to review someone else's booking - should fail (403)
# Still logged in as participant2, try to use participant1's booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de22ba-5ec8-40c1-82c0-39ea79af0cc1",
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Trying to review someone else's booking"
}

###
# 13. ❌ Motard tries to review (wrong role) - should fail (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "motard1",
  "password": "pass"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de22ba-5ec8-40c1-82c0-39ea79af0cc1",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Motard trying to review"
}

###
# 14. View organizer profile with aggregated reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/motards/{{organizerId}}

###
# Expected Results Summary:
# Test 3: 400 - Cannot review before tour date
# Test 5: 201 - Review created successfully (with comment)
# Test 6: 400 - Duplicate review error
# Test 7: 400 - Rating must be 1-5
# Test 8: 400 - Rating must be 1-5
# Test 11: 201 - Review created (no comment is OK)
# Test 12: 403 - Cannot review other's booking
# Test 13: 403 - Wrong role (Motard cannot review)
# Test 14: 200 - Profile shows reviews including new ones
